From 9e91479d1f019f038b57f136c06fc231874a0504 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mathias <77238760+MathiasMortus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 09:09:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 58/66] Glint: guard extension action clicks in tabless windows
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Clicking a toolbar extension action in a window with zero tabs (empty
workspace) crashed in ExtensionAction::GetIsVisibleInternal — bail in
ExecuteUserAction when there is no active WebContents.
---
 .../resources/glint_ui/assets/styles.css       |  2 +-
 .../browser/resources/glint_ui/background.js   |  2 +-
 .../resources/glint_ui/chunks/styles.js        | 18 +++++++++---------
 chrome/browser/resources/glint_ui/sidepanel.js |  2 +-
 .../extensions/extension_action_view_model.cc  |  5 +++++
 5 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/resources/glint_ui/assets/styles.css b/chrome/browser/resources/glint_ui/assets/styles.css
index 025f86de51..9e39dfe903 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/resources/glint_ui/assets/styles.css
+++ b/chrome/browser/resources/glint_ui/assets/styles.css
@@ -1 +1 @@
